      "label": "Sorcerer",
      "_note": "The Mentalist's cousin, and the other archetype a VPP invites — see the NO VPPs note at the top. Spells go in a multipower instead: the same reach, but the player can see what they've got.\n\nED over PD, in the spread and in the sigil, because what a mystic soaks is rarely a fist. Unlike the Mentalist it attacks with a Blast rather than a thought, so it reads DC 12 / oAP 60 — the campaign baseline — where the Mentalist reads DC 6 for the same 60 active points.\n\nDefences held near greyman's shape (DEF 20, rDEF 13, dAP 39) rather than the Energy Projector's: dAP compounds against DCV x DEF x rDEF in the Rule of X, and this is a DCV 6 character. That term is where a defensive stack runs away, and it has caught two archetypes already.",
